OL,3,GNEWSAThousands raised for Lidl crash
OL,4,Avictim's family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of pounds have poured in for
OL,7,Fthe family of a "much-loved" man who
OL,8,Fwas killed after a car crashed through
OL,9,Fthe entrance of a Lidl supermarket.
OL,11,FFather-of-two James Singh Jagpal, 39,
OL,12,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene of the
OL,13,Fcrash in Wolverhampton, which emergency
OL,14,Fservices were called to just before
OL,15,F18:00BST on 23 October.
OL,17,FAn online fundraiser has been set up to
OL,18,Fhelp towards his funeral costs and,
OL,19,Fwithin just two days, more than #8,100
OL,20,Fhas been raised.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
