OL,3,GNEWSAThousands raised for Lidl crash
OL,4,Avictim's family
OL,5,
OL,6,F"No family should ever have to
OL,7,Fexperience such heartbreaking loss, and
OL,8,Fno words can truly express the pain and
OL,9,Femptiness left behind," said Sophie
OL,10,FJagpal, a family member who set up the
OL,11,Fpage.
